{"type":"FeatureCollection","name":"沙面历史建筑","metadata":{"coordinate_system":"WGS84","source":"OpenStreetMap contributors (Overpass API), ODbL 1.0","generated":"2026-11-12","poi_count":23},"features":[{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.242538,23.110077],[113.242801,23.110067],[113.2428,23.110048],[113.242797,23.109973],[113.242794,23.109897],[113.242793,23.109878],[113.24253,23.109888],[113.242531,23.109907],[113.242534,23.109983],[113.242538,23.110058],[113.242538,23.110077]]]},"properties":{"id":"shamian-10","name_zh":"法国兵营旧址","name_en":"Former French Barracks","address":"沙面大街10、12号","category":"military","built_year":1890,"built_label":"约1890年代","built_precision":"decade","visible_from":1890,"renovated":["2023—2024"],"architect":"未详","original_use":"教会附属/军事","current_use":"文化展示/办公","style":"殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"沙面大街10号即法国兵营旧址，位于法租界14号地块，毗邻露德圣母堂。建筑始建于19世纪90年代，最早由巴黎外方传教会拍得，作为教会附属建筑使用；租界时期几经易手，主要作商住与外国人活动场所。1949年后曾为国企办公地，后一度为母婴会所。2023—2024年完成保护活化，2024年出版《广州沙面大街10号保护活化实录》。","events":["e-1859","e-1861","e-1946","e-1949","e-1950","e-2024"],"sources":["《广州沙面大街10号保护活化实录》","广州市情网","OpenStreetMap"],"confidence":"high","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610321,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/shamian-10.webp","caption":"沙面大街10、12号沿街立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9710%E3%80%8112%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.109978,113.242666]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.24233,23.110126],[113.242424,23.110122],[113.242415,23.109939],[113.24239,23.10994],[113.242388,23.109907],[113.242343,23.109909],[113.242344,23.109942],[113.242322,23.109943],[113.24233,23.110126]]]},"properties":{"id":"lourdes","name_zh":"露德圣母堂","name_en":"Church of Our Lady of Lourdes","address":"沙面大街14号","category":"church","built_year":1890,"built_label":"1890","built_precision":"exact","visible_from":1890,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"天主教堂","current_use":"天主教堂","style":"哥特复兴式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"露德圣母堂位于沙面大街14号，1890年建成，是沙面法租界最重要的宗教建筑之一。教堂为哥特复兴式，正面设尖券门洞与玫瑰窗，立面比例严谨。1996年随沙面建筑群列为全国重点文物保护单位，今仍作为天主教堂使用。","events":["e-1861","e-1890","e-1946"],"sources":["《广州沙面大街10号保护活化实录》","广州市情网","OpenStreetMap"],"confidence":"high","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":392765468,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/lourdes.webp","caption":"露德圣母堂正面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9714%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.109979,113.242369]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.242523,23.109077],[113.242744,23.109071],[113.242736,23.108826],[113.242681,23.108827],[113.24268,23.1088],[113.242672,23.108789],[113.242661,23.108787],[113.242587,23.108789],[113.242577,23.108791],[113.24257,23.108803],[113.24257,23.10883],[113.242515,23.108832],[113.242523,23.109077]]]},"properties":{"id":"french-consulate","name_zh":"法国驻广州领事馆旧址","name_en":"Former French Consulate","address":"沙面南街18、20号","category":"consulate","built_year":1890,"built_label":"1890（1915年扩建）","built_precision":"exact","visible_from":1890,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"领事馆","current_use":"广东外事博物馆","style":"新古典主义/殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"法国驻广州领事馆旧址位于沙面南街18、20号，1890年随法国领事馆迁入沙面而设，1915年扩建。建筑为两层殖民地外廊式，立面强调轴线与门廊。1946年租界收回后结束领事用途，后由外事部门使用，现为广东外事博物馆。","events":["e-1861","e-1890","e-1943","e-1946","e-1950"],"sources":["《广州沙面大街10号保护活化实录》","广州市情网","OpenStreetMap"],"confidence":"high","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610325,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/french-consulate.webp","caption":"沙面南街18号外立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","licen