关俱乐部/职员宿舍","current_use":"办公","style":"红砖清水墙、殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"海关馆舍位于沙面大街2、4、6号，因红砖外墙俗称“东红楼”，1909年竣工，曾为粤海关俱乐部及海关职员宿舍。建筑以红砖清水墙、白色线脚和连续外廊为特征，是沙面东端的重要地标。1996年随沙面建筑群列为全国重点文物保护单位。","events":["e-1909"],"sources":["《广州沙面大街10号保护活化实录》","广州市情网","OpenStreetMap 标注 start_date=1907"],"confidence":"high","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610283,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/customs-club.webp","caption":"沙面大街2、4、6号红砖立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%972%E3%80%814%E3%80%816%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.110025,113.243347]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.241356,23.110239],[113.241591,23.11023],[113.241575,23.10987],[113.24134,23.109879],[113.241356,23.110239]]]},"properties":{"id":"bank-taiwan","name_zh":"台湾银行广州支行旧址","name_en":"Former Bank of Taiwan, Guangzhou Branch","address":"沙面大街26号","category":"bank","built_year":1907,"built_label":"1907（建筑年代一说1911）","built_precision":"exact","visible_from":1907,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"银行","current_use":"办公/商业","style":"新古典主义","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"台湾银行广州支行旧址位于沙面大街26号，1907年设立，是日资银行在华南的代表性机构。建筑立面采用新古典主义构图，强调中央入口与横向线脚；另有资料将建筑年代记为1911年。1996年随沙面建筑群列为全国重点文物保护单位。","events":[],"sources":["广州市情网","OpenStreetMap 标注 start_date=1911","Wikimedia Commons"],"confidence":"medium","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610322,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/bank-taiwan.webp","caption":"沙面大街26号外立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9726%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.110055,113.241466]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.23968