。1996年随沙面建筑群列为全国重点文物保护单位，今仍为宗教活动场所。","events":["e-1864"],"sources":["广州市情网","Wikimedia Commons","OpenStreetMap"],"confidence":"high","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":509641361,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/christ-church.webp","caption":"沙面基督教堂现貌（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%97%E8%A1%9760%E5%8F%B7.jpg"},{"src":"./assets/img/historical/christ-church-1895.webp","caption":"沙面英国教堂旧影（约1895）","credit":"Unknown author","license":"Public domain","license_url":"","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:English_Church_Shameen_Canton.jpg"}],"center":[23.109552,113.236305]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[113.23818,23.1101]},"properties":{"id":"hsbc","name_zh":"汇丰银行旧址","name_en":"Former HSBC Building","address":"沙面大街54号","category":"bank","built_year":1920,"built_label":"1920","built_precision":"exact","visible_from":1920,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"银行","current_use":"酒店/办公（未详）","style":"新古典主义","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"汇丰银行旧址位于沙面大街54号，1920年建成，是英资汇丰银行在沙面的营业场所。建筑立面采用新古典主义构图，底层设拱廊，二层以上以壁柱划分开间。抗战胜利后曾作其他用途，现属沙面建筑群全国重点文物保护单位。此处以门牌定位，OSM 未提供独立建筑轮廓。","events":[],"sources":["广州市情网","Wikimedia Commons","OpenStreetMap 门牌定位"],"confidence":"medium","geometry_precision":"point","osm_id":null,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/hsbc.webp","caption":"沙面大街54号外立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9754%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.1101,113.23818]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.239136,23.109407],[113.239146,23.109648],[113.23936,23.109641],[113.239386,23.109619],[113.239378,23.109415],[113.239283,23.109418],[113.239282,23.109402],[113.239136,23.109407]]]},"properties":{"id":"chartered-bank","name_zh":"渣打银行旧址","name_en":"Former Chartered Bank","address":"沙面大街49号","category":"bank","built_year":1910,"built_label":"约1910年代","built_precision":"decade","visible_from":1910,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"银行","current_use":"办公/商业","style":"殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"渣打银行旧址位于沙面大街49号，约建于1910年代，是英资渣打银行在沙面的分支机构。建筑为三层殖民地外廊式，立面以连续拱廊和水平线脚为特征。1996年随沙面建筑群列为全国重点文物保护单位。","events":[],"sources":["广州市情网","Wikimedia Commons","OpenStreetMap"],"confidence":"medium","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610265,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/chartered-bank.webp","caption":"沙面大街49号沿街立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9749%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.109507,113.239282]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.238724,23.110036],[113.238733,23.110276],[113.239039,23.110267],[113.239031,23.110027],[113.238724,23.110036]]]},"properties":{"id":"russell","name_zh":"旗昌洋行旧址","name_en":"Former Russell & Co.","address":"沙面大街48号","category":"bank","built_year":1890,"built_label":"约1890年代","built_precision":"century","visible_from":1890,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"洋行","current_use":"办公/商业","style":"殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"旗昌洋行旧址位于沙面大街48号，是沙面现存较早的洋行建筑之一。旗昌洋行（Russell & Co.）为19世纪美国在华的著名商行。文物名录将建筑年代记为19世纪末，本页在时间轴上以约1890年代作为近似显示起点。现属沙面建筑群全国重点文物保护单位。","events":[],"sources":["广州市荔湾区不可移动文物名录（19世纪末）","广州市情网","Wikimedia Commons"],"confidence":"medium","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610309,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/russell.webp","caption":"沙面大街48号外立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9748%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.110152,113.238882]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.236575,23.110212],[113.236668,23.110209],[113.236685,23.110208],[113.236679,23.11007],[113.236662,23.110071],[113.236659,23.110008],[113.236566,23.110012],[113.236567,23.110042],[113.236552,23.110042],[113.236559,23.110184],[113.236574,23.110183],[113.236575,23.110212]]]},"properties":{"id":"taihe","name_zh":"泰和洋行旧址","name_en":"Former Taihe Foreign Firm","address":"沙面五街4号","category":"bank","built_year":1912,"built_label":"1912","built_precision":"year","visible_from":1912,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"洋行/住宅","current_use":"办公/商业","style":"殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summary":"泰和洋行旧址位于沙面五街4号，约建于1912年，曾为洋行办公与住宅使用。建筑为三层殖民地外廊式，立面简洁，设有连续拱券外廊。其早期业主与具体沿革仍待进一步核对，现属沙面建筑群全国重点文物保护单位。","events":[],"sources":["OpenStreetMap 标注 start_date=1912","Wikimedia Commons"],"confidence":"medium","geometry_precision":"polygon","osm_id":352610300,"images":[{"src":"./assets/img/buildings/taihe.webp","caption":"沙面五街4号外立面（2023）","credit":"Inclavatura","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%974%E5%8F%B7.jpg"}],"center":[23.110113,113.236613]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[113.23694,23.110235],[113.237066,23.110231],[113.237067,23.110262],[113.237109,23.110261],[113.237108,23.110229],[113.237099,23.109995],[113.236931,23.11],[113.23694,23.110235]]]},"properties":{"id":"loxley","name_zh":"洛士利洋行旧址","name_en":"Former Loxley & Co.","address":"沙面大街62号","category":"bank","built_year":1906,"built_label":"1906（20世纪初）","built_precision":"exact","visible_from":1906,"renovated":[],"architect":"未详","original_use":"洋行","current_use":"办公/商业","style":"殖民地外廊式","heritage_status":"全国重点文物保护单位（沙面建筑群组成部分）","summ